{"instruction": "What field map stem corresponds to field id 0 in FF7's field map list?", "input": "Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/scripts/field_maplist.py (MAPLIST, verified against Makou MapList.cpp)", "output": "<thinking>\nMAPLIST is index-aligned to field id; index 0 holds \"dummy\" in the\n        verified array from `field_maplist.py`. Uppercased, this matches the\n        on-disc/field-file stem \"DUMMY\" used by field-file naming and MAPJUMP\n        (0x60) targets.\n</thinking>\n```python\n# Verified single-entry subset of MAPLIST (field_maplist.py / MapList.cpp).\nMAPLIST_PARTIAL = {0: 'dummy'}\n\ndef stem_for_field_id(field_id: int) -> str:\n    return MAPLIST_PARTIAL[field_id].upper()\n\nassert stem_for_field_id(0) == 'DUMMY'\n```"}
