{"instruction": "Given the field-file stem \"DUMMY\", what field id does it map to in FF7?", "input": "Final-Fantasy-7-CSR/scripts/field_maplist.py (STEM_TO_ID inverse of MAPLIST)", "output": "<thinking>\nSTEM_TO_ID is built as {name.upper(): i for i, name in enumerate(MAPLIST) if name},\n        so it inverts MAPLIST. \"DUMMY\" (lowercased: \"dummy\") lives at index 0\n        in MAPLIST, so STEM_TO_ID[\"DUMMY\"] == 0.\n</thinking>\n```python\nSTEM_TO_ID_PARTIAL = {'DUMMY': 0}\n\ndef id_for_stem(stem: str) -> int:\n    return STEM_TO_ID_PARTIAL[stem.upper()]\n\nassert id_for_stem('dummy') == 0\n```"}
